1126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\">Send money to Togo →</a></div></section>\n<div style=\"background:#F6F4EF\">\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">What businesses do in Togo.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Pay suppliers in XOF</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Fund in USDC or USDT and settle invoices in Togo to Moov Money and Mixx by Yas.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Payroll in Togo</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Pay employees and contractors in West African CFA francs in one run from a single stablecoin balance.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Collect XOF, settle in USDC</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Accept local payments from customers in Togo and hold the proceeds in USDC or USDT.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Embed ramps in your product</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Fintechs and wallets offer XOF on- and off-ramps to their own users through our API.</p></div></div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">How it works.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,240px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">01</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:12px 0 0\">Verify your business</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:inherit;opacity:.85;margin:8px 0 0\">Complete onboarding once to pay and collect across all 20 countries.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#FFB224;color:#131126\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">02</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:12px 0 0\">Fund in stablecoins</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:inherit;opacity:.85;margin:8px 0 0\">Send USDC or USDT, or use your existing ElementPay balance.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#7C6FFF;color:#131126\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">03</span><h3 style=\"font-