px;color:#4C4A66\">Yes. Customers pay in XOF locally and the proceeds settle into USDC or USDT on your balance.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"padding:22px 24px;font-weight:600;font-size:17px\">How fast are payouts in Togo?</summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Most mobile money payouts are sent on local rails as soon as you confirm, with a status for every payment.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"padding:22px 24px;font-weight:600;font-size:17px\">Is this for individuals?</summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">No. ElementPay is built for businesses, and every account goes through business verification.</p></details></div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><div style=\"border-radius:28px;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff;padding:clamp(36px,6vw,80px);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-0.045em;font-weight:700;margin:0;max-width:12ch\">Start paying in Togo.</h2><a href=\"/contact\" style=\"padding:16px 28px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#fff;color:#3B2ED3\" class=\"dp-16y87us\">Talk to sales</a></div></section>\n\n</div>"
